# Remote node: with "Include messages" on, the backup holds this device's
# history of the node too; after this device is erased, Restore brings the
# conversations back.
# remote-only
node Bob 7.5 echo
as Bob advert
wait 3000
key menu
key up 20   # the menu keeps its cursor: back to the first row
key down 3
key enter
wait 2000
hold esc 900
as Bob dm Cardputer hello there
wait 4000
expect threads 1
# Backup & restore: Include messages on, then Back up now
key menu
key up 20   # the menu keeps its cursor: back to the first row
key down 11
key enter
key down 2
key enter
key down
key enter
wait 500
shot backup-with-messages
wipe
wait 6000
expect threads 0
key menu
key up 20   # the menu keeps its cursor: back to the first row
key down 11
key enter
key down 4
key enter
key y
wait 6000
shot history-restored
expect threads 1
